      <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Provably Fair qanday ishlaydi?</summary><div class="faq-a">Har raund boshlanishidan oldin hash orqali shifrlanadi va natija o'zgarmas qoladi.</div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Spribe kim?</summary><div class="faq-a">Aviator o'yinining rasmiy litsenziyalangan yaratuvchisi (2019 yildan).</div></details>
    </section>

